OL,3,GNEWSATeen killed in electric motorcycle
OL,4,Acrash with van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager riding an electric
OL,7,Fmotorcycle has died in a crash with a
OL,8,Fvan.
OL,10,FMcKenzie Ratcliffe, 18, from North
OL,11,FShields, was riding on Waterville Road,
OL,12,Fnear Meadow Well, on Wednesday, when he
OL,13,Fhit a Mercedes Sprinter van,
OL,14,FNorthumbria Police said.
OL,16,FHe was pronounced dead a short time
OL,17,Flater and the driver of the van, a man
OL,18,Fin his 60s, remained at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
