OL,3,GNEWSATeen killed in electric motorcycle
OL,4,Acrash with van
OL,5,
OL,6,FSgt Craig Bartle said the force was
OL,7,Fcarrying out an investigation and its
OL,8,Fthoughts were with McKenzie's family
OL,9,Fand friends.
